    <section id="about" class="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-label">About</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text reveal">
          <h2 id="about-heading">We Are<br>GLASS</h2>
          <p>The Greater Lowell Area Science-based Skeptics (GLASS) is a group of curious, open-minded individuals who
            value evidence, reason, and the scientific method. We meet regularly to discuss topics ranging from
            pseudoscience and the paranormal to medical myths and critical thinking skills.</p>
          <p>Whether you're a lifelong skeptic or just starting to question the world around you, GLASS is a welcoming
            community for anyone who believes that good thinking matters.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="about-values">
          <li class="reveal">
            <span class="value-num">01</span>
            <strong>Science</strong>
            <span>We trust the scientific method as the best tool for understanding the world.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s">
            <span class="value-num">02</span>
            <strong>Reason</strong>
            <span>We apply logic and critical thinking to evaluate claims and evidence.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s">
            <span class="value-num">03</span>
            <strong>Community</strong>
            <span>We foster a welcoming space for curious minds of all backgrounds.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
